const pages=[['roll','擲骰大廳','✦'],['inventory','骰子背包','▦'],['codex','收藏圖鑑','◈'],['pets','寵物合成','♧'],['gloves','手套工坊','♧'],['potions','藥水工坊','⚗'],['weather-summon','天氣召喚','✧'],['quests','任務成就','☷'],['leaderboard','排行榜','♜'],['profile','設定','◎'],['admin','管理員面板','⚙']];
function isAdmin(){return (currentUser?.email||'').toLowerCase()==='toby110403@gmail.com'}
let realmLastMessageId=0,realmCurrentPollId=null,realmPollExpiry=0,realmPollTimer=null,realmAnnouncementTimer=null,realmLastPollId=0;
function realmUsername(){return String(S?.username||S?.playerName||currentUser?.user_metadata?.username||'玩家').slice(0,40)}
function realmShowAnnouncement(row){const el=document.getElementById('realmAnnouncement');if(!el||!row)return;el.textContent=`【${row.admin_label||'𝓗𝓮𝓻𝓶𝓮𝓼'}】: ${row.message||''}`;el.style.display='block';clearTimeout(realmAnnouncementTimer);realmAnnouncementTimer=setTimeout(()=>{el.style.display='none'},3800)}
function realmHidePoll(){const el=document.getElementById('realmPollPopup');if(el)el.style.display='none';if(realmPollTimer){clearInterval(realmPollTimer);realmPollTimer=null}realmCurrentPollId=null}
async function realmRefreshPollResults(pollId){if(!isAdmin()||!pollId)return;const box=document.getElementById('adminPollResults');if(!box)return;try{const [{data:votes,error},{data:poll,pollError}]=await Promise.all([supabaseClient.from('realm_poll_votes').select('username,choice,created_at').eq('poll_id',pollId).order('created_at',{ascending:false}),supabaseClient.from('realm_polls').select('option_a,option_b,question').eq('id',pollId).maybeSingle().then(r=>({data:r.data,pollError:r.error}))]);if(error)throw error;if(pollError)throw pollError;const rows=votes||[],a=rows.filter(v=>v.choice==='hell').length,b=rows.filter(v=>v.choice==='crystal').length,labelA=poll?.option_a||'選項一',labelB=poll?.option_b||'選項二',safeA=escapeHTML(labelA),safeB=escapeHTML(labelB);box.innerHTML=`<div class="card" style="padding:12px"><b>${escapeHTML(poll?.question||'投票結果')}</b><div style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;margin-top:8px"><span>${safeA}</span><b>${a} 票</b></div><div style="height:7px;background:#272c43;border-radius:9px;overflow:hidden;margin:5px 0 10px"><div style="height:100%;width:${rows.length?a/rows.length*100:0}%;background:#f34d60"></div></div><div style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between"><span>${safeB}</span><b>${b} 票</b></div><div style="height:7px;background:#272c43;border-radius:9px;overflow:hidden;margin:5px 0 10px"><div style="height:100%;width:${rows.length?b/rows.length*100:0}%;background:#b57bff"></div></div><div class="mini">總投票：${rows.length} 人</div><details style="margin-top:8px"><summary>查看投票玩家名單</summary>${rows.length?rows.map(v=>`<div class="admin-log"><span>${escapeHTML(v.username||'玩家')}</span><b>${v.choice==='hell'?safeA:safeB}</b></div>`).join(''):'<div class="empty">目前還沒有人投票。</div>'}</details></div>`}catch(e){box.innerHTML='<div class="empty">讀取投票結果失敗：'+escapeHTML(e.message||'未知錯誤')+'</div>'}}
async function realmPollTick(){if(!currentUser||!supabaseClient)return;try{const now=new Date().toISOString();const {data:messages,error:msgErr}=await supabaseClient.from('realm_admin_messages').select('id,message,admin_label,created_at,expires_at').gt('expires_at',now).order('id',{ascending:false}).limit(1);if(!msgErr&&messages?.length&&Number(messages[0].id)>realmLastMessageId){realmLastMessageId=Number(messages[0].id);realmShowAnnouncement(messages[0])}
const {data:polls,error:pollErr}=await supabaseClient.from('realm_polls').select('id,question,option_a,option_b,admin_label,created_at,ends_at,is_active').eq('is_active',true).gt('ends_at',now).order('id',{ascending:false}).limit(1);if(pollErr||!polls?.length){if(realmCurrentPollId&&Date.now()>=realmPollExpiry)realmHidePoll();return}const poll=polls[0];if(Number(poll.id)!==realmCurrentPollId){realmCurrentPollId=Number(poll.id);realmLastPollId=realmCurrentPollId;realmPollExpiry=Date.parse(poll.ends_at)||Date.now();const popup=document.getElementById('realmPollPopup');document.getElementById('realmPollHeadline').textContent=`【${poll.admin_label||'𝓗𝓮𝓻𝓶𝓮𝓼'}】: ${poll.question}`;document.querySelector('#realmPollButtons [data-poll-choice="hell"]').textContent=poll.option_a||'選項一';document.querySelector('#realmPollButtons [data-poll-choice="crystal"]').textContent=poll.option_b||'選項二';document.getElementById('realmPollButtons').style.display='grid';document.getElementById('realmPollVoteStatus').textContent='每位玩家只能投票一次';popup.style.display='block';const {data:existing}=await supabaseClient.from('realm_poll_votes').select('id,choice').eq('poll_id',poll.id).eq('user_id',currentUser.id).maybeSingle();if(existing){document.getElementById('realmPollVoteStatus').textContent=`你已投票：${existing.choice==='hell'?(poll.option_a||'選項一'):(poll.option_b||'選項二')}`;document.getElementById('realmPollButtons').style.display='none'}if(realmPollTimer)clearInterval(realmPollTimer);realmPollTimer=setInterval(()=>{const remain=Math.max(0,Math.ceil((realmPollExpiry-Date.now())/1000));document.getElementById('realmPollCountdown').textContent=remain>0?`剩餘 ${remain} 秒`:'投票已結束';if(remain<=0)realmHidePoll()},250)}if(isAdmin())realmRefreshPollResults(Number(poll.id))
}catch(e){console.warn('全服訊息／投票同步失敗',e)}}
async function realmSendMessage(){if(!isAdmin())return;const input=document.getElementById('adminBroadcastText'),status=document.getElementById('adminBroadcastStatus'),message=input.value.trim();if(!message){status.textContent='請先輸入訊息。';return}const btn=document.getElementById('adminBroadcastSendBtn');btn.disabled=true;status.textContent='正在發送…';try{const {error}=await supabaseClient.from('realm_admin_messages').insert({message,admin_label:'𝓗𝓮𝓻𝓶𝓮𝓼',expires_at:new Date(Date.now()+3800).toISOString()});if(error)throw error;status.textContent='已發送；玩家畫面會顯示 3.8 秒。';input.value='';realmLastMessageId=0;await realmPollTick()}catch(e){status.textContent='發送失敗：'+(e.message||'請稍後重試')}finally{btn.disabled=false}}
async function realmStartPoll(){if(!isAdmin())return;const question=document.getElementById('adminPollQuestion').value.trim(),optionA=document.getElementById('adminPollOptionA').value.trim(),optionB=document.getElementById('adminPollOptionB').value.trim(),duration=Number(document.getElementById('adminPollDuration').value)||60,status=document.getElementById('adminPollStatus'),btn=document.getElementById('adminPollStartBtn');if(!question){status.textContent='請先輸入投票問題。';return}if(!optionA||!optionB){status.textContent='請分別填寫選項一與選項二。';return}if(optionA.toLocaleLowerCase()===optionB.toLocaleLowerCase()){status.textContent='兩個選項不能完全相同。';return}if(!confirm(`確定發起「${question}」投票？\n選項一：${optionA}\n選項二：${optionB}\n時間：${duration} 秒。\n目前進行中的投票會被結束。`))return;btn.disabled=true;status.textContent='正在發起投票…';try{const {error:closeErr}=await supabaseClient.from('realm_polls').update({is_active:false}).eq('is_active',true);if(closeErr)throw closeErr;const {data,error}=await supabaseClient.from('realm_polls').insert({question,option_a:optionA,option_b:optionB,admin_label:'𝓗𝓮𝓻𝓶𝓮𝓼',ends_at:new Date(Date.now()+duration*1000).toISOString(),is_active:true}).select('id').single();if(error)throw error;status.textContent=`投票已發起：「${optionA}」與「${optionB}」，持續 ${duration} 秒；系統會自動統計票數。`;realmCurrentPollId=null;await realmPollTick();await realmRefreshPollResults(data.id)}catch(e){status.textContent='發起失敗：'+(e.message||'請稍後重試')}finally{btn.disabled=false}}
document.getElementById('adminBroadcastSendBtn')?.addEventListener('click',realmSendMessage);document.getElementById('adminPollStartBtn')?.addEventListener('click',realmStartPoll);
document.getElementById('realmPollButtons')?.addEventListener('click',async e=>{const btn=e.target.closest('[data-poll-choice]');if(!btn||!realmCurrentPollId||!currentUser)return;const choice=btn.dataset.pollChoice;document.querySelectorAll('#realmPollButtons button').forEach(b=>b.disabled=true);try{const {error}=await supabaseClient.from('realm_poll_votes').insert({poll_id:realmCurrentPollId,user_id:currentUser.id,username:realmUsername(),choice});if(error){if(error.code==='23505')throw new Error('你已經投過票了');throw error}document.getElementById('realmPollVoteStatus').textContent=`投票成功：${document.querySelector(`#realmPollButtons [data-poll-choice=\"${choice}\"]`)?.textContent||'已投票'}`;document.getElementById('realmPollButtons').style.display='none';if(isAdmin())await realmRefreshPollResults(realmCurrentPollId)}catch(err){document.getElementById('realmPollVoteStatus').textContent=err.message||'投票失敗';document.querySelectorAll('#realmPollButtons button').forEach(b=>b.disabled=false)}});
setInterval(realmPollTick,1500);
function updateAdminVisibility(){const allowed=isAdmin();document.body.classList.toggle('admin-pets-unlocked',allowed);document.querySelectorAll('[data-page="admin"]').forEach(b=>b.hidden=!allowed);const panel=document.getElementById('page-admin');panel.hidden=!allowed;if(!allowed&&panel.classList.contains('active'))go('roll')}
function navHTML(){return pages.map(([id,n,i])=>`<button data-page="${id}" data-nav-id="${id}" class="${id==='roll'?'active':''}" ${id==='admin'?'hidden':''}>${i} ${n}</button>`).join('')}
document.getElementById('sideNav').innerHTML='<small>GAME MENU</small>'+navHTML();document.getElementById('mobileNav').innerHTML=navHTML();
function go(id){if(id==='admin'&&!isAdmin()){toast('沒有管理員權限');return}document.querySelectorAll('.page').forEach(p=>p.classList.toggle('active',p.id==='page-'+id));document.querySelectorAll('[data-page]').forEach(b=>b.classList.toggle('active',b.dataset.page===id));if(id==='admin')loadAdminDashboard();if(id==='leaderboard')refreshLeaderboards();if(id==='weather-summon')loadWeatherSummonData();if(id==='pets')renderPetsPage();window.scrollTo({top:0,behavior:'smooth'})}
document.addEventListener('click',e=>{let b=e.target.closest('[data-page],[data-go]');if(!b)return;go(b.dataset.page||b.dataset.go)});
function itemHTML(d,owned=true){let count=S.bag[d.id]||0;return `<article class="item ${d.den>=65536?'ultra':d.den>=2048?'rare':''}" style="--c:${d.color}"><div class="count">${owned?'×'+count:'???'}</div><div class="ico ${['d33','d34','d35','d36'].includes(d.id)?'halloween-compact':''}" style="color:${owned?(d.iconColor||d.color):'#525873'}">${owned?d.icon:'?'}</div><h3>${owned?d.name:'未知骰子'}</h3><p>${owned?chanceText(d):'尚未發現'}</p><p>${owned?d.desc:'繼續擲骰以解鎖資料。'}</p>${owned&&S.first[d.id]?`<p>首次：${new Date(S.first[d.id]).toLocaleDateString()}</p>`:''}</article>`}

function renderAutoSellOptions(){const box=document.getElementById('autoSellDiceOptions');if(!box)return;const halloweenIds=new Set(['d33','d34','d35','d36']);const categoryOrder=d=>halloweenIds.has(d.id)?1:d.weather?({rain:2,snow:3,thunder:4,crystal:5,hell:6}[d.weather]??7):0;const dice=D.filter(d=>Number(d.den)>=2&&Number(d.den)<=600000).slice().sort((a,b)=>categoryOrder(a)-categoryOrder(b)||Number(a.den)-Number(b.den));const renderOne=d=>{const isHalloween=halloweenIds.has(d.id),selected=(S.autoDeleteDice||[]).includes(d.id),color=isHalloween?'#ff8a3d':d.weather?({rain:'#3298ff',snow:'#ffffff',thunder:'#fff000',crystal:'#d56bff',hell:'#ff3434'}[d.weather]||'#4df27c'):'#4df27c';return `<label class="auto-sell-option"><input type="checkbox" data-auto-delete="${d.id}" ${selected?'checked':''}><span style="color:${color}"><b>${chanceText(d)}</b> ${d.name}${isHalloween?'（萬聖節）':d.weather?`（${({rain:'雨',snow:'雪',thunder:'打雷',crystal:'水晶',hell:'地獄'}[d.weather]||'天氣')}）`:''}</span></label>`};box.innerHTML=dice.map(renderOne).join('')}
function renderAutoDepositOptions(){const box=document.getElementById('autoDepositDiceOptions');if(!box)return;const order={rain:0,snow:1,thunder:2,crystal:3,hell:4},labels={rain:'🌧️ 雨',snow:'❄️ 雪',thunder:'⚡ 雷',crystal:'💎 水晶',hell:'🔥 地獄'},colors={rain:'#3298ff',snow:'#ffffff',thunder:'#fff000',crystal:'#e34dff',hell:'#9b0018'};const arr=D.filter(d=>!!d.weather&&Number(d.den)>=2&&Number(d.den)<=1000000).slice().sort((a,b)=>(order[a.weather]??99)-(order[b.weather]??99)||a.den-b.den);let last='';box.innerHTML=arr.map(d=>{const selected=(S.autoDepositDice||[]).includes(d.id),color=colors[d.weather]||'#dce4ff';let heading='';if(last!==d.weather){last=d.weather;heading=`<div class="auto-weather-group-title" style="color:${color}">${labels[d.weather]||d.weather}天氣（機率由小到大）</div>`;}return `${heading}<label class="auto-sell-option"><input type="checkbox" data-auto-deposit-dice="${d.id}" ${selected?'checked':''}><span style="color:${color}"><b>${chanceText(d)}</b> ${escapeHTML(d.name)}</span></label>`}).join('')||'<div class="empty">目前沒有可設定的天氣骰子。</div>'; }
let inventorySellMode=false;
function updateInventorySelectedCount(){const grid=document.getElementById('inventoryGrid');if(!grid)return;const total=grid.querySelectorAll('input[data-sell-select]:checked').length;const label=document.getElementById('inventorySelectedCount');const button=document.getElementById('sellSelectedDiceBtn');if(label)label.textContent=inventorySellMode?`已選擇 ${format(total)} 顆骰子`:'一般模式';if(button){button.textContent=inventorySellMode?(total?`出售已選骰子 (${format(total)})`:'取消選擇'):'出售';button.disabled=false}}
function renderInventory(){const grid=document.getElementById('inventoryGrid');const halloweenIds=new Set(['d33','d34','d35','d36']);const mutationColors={rain:'#3298ff',snow:'#ffffff',thunder:'#fff000',crystal:'#d56bff',hell:'#ff3434'};const categoryOrder=d=>halloweenIds.has(d.id)?1:d.weather?({rain:2,snow:3,thunder:4,crystal:5,hell:6}[d.weather]??7):0;const arr=D.filter(d=>(Number(S.bag[d.id])||0)>0).sort((a,b)=>categoryOrder(a)-categoryOrder(b)||Number(a.den)-Number(b.den));let html='';for(const d of arr){const count=Number(S.bag[d.id])||0;const halloween=halloweenIds.has(d.id);const color=halloween?'#ff8a3d':(mutationColors[d.weather]||'#4df27c');for(let n=0;n<count;n++){html+=`<label class="inventory-tile" style="--rarity-color:${color};color:${color}" title="${escapeHTML(d.name)} · ${chanceText(d)}"><input type="checkbox" data-sell-select="${d.id}" aria-label="選擇出售${escapeHTML(d.name)}第${n+1}顆"><span class="tile-chance" style="color:${color}">${chanceText(d)}</span><span class="tile-icon" style="color:${color}">${d.icon}</span><span class="tile-name" style="color:${color}">${escapeHTML(d.name)}</span><span class="tile-index">#${n+1}</span></label>`}}grid.innerHTML=html||'<div class="empty" style="grid-column:1/-1">背包目前沒有骰子。</div>';document.getElementById('bagCount').textContent=format(totalDice())+' 顆';updateInventorySelectedCount()}

document.getElementById('autoSellDiceOptions').addEventListener('change',e=>{const id=e.target.dataset.autoDelete;if(!id)return;const set=new Set(S.autoDeleteDice||[]);if(e.target.checked)set.add(id);else set.delete(id);S.autoDeleteDice=[...set];save();toast(e.target.checked?'已加入自動出售清單':'已從自動出售清單移除');});

